# ARCCROSS Visual Polish & Dopamine Brainstorming

Here is a roadmap of visual enhancements and dopamine-trigger loops we can implement using only **AI-generated assets** and **template sprites** (leveraging Godot's UI layouts, shaders, and Tweens).

---

## 1. The Loot Dopamine Loop (Detailed Popups & Cards)

In survival games, finding rare junk or a weapon is the ultimate high. Right now, loot is just text. Let's make finding an item feel like opening a pack of cards.

*   **AI Asset Requirement:** Generate high-fidelity, gritty, square-ratio icons for every item in the game (e.g. clean water, stim shot, makeshift sidearm, thermal undershirt) using prompts like:
    > *"gritty post-apocalyptic survival item icon, makeshift rusty pistol, pixel art style, dark background, 2D game asset"*
*   **The Dopamine Hook:** 
    *   When you scavenge a POI or rob an enemy, trigger a **Loot Gained Card** popup.
    *   This is a dark panel with a glowing border matching the item's type/rarity.
    *   The card plays a slow zoom-in tween on the AI-generated icon, accompanied by neon-green text showing its properties (Threat, Weight).

